{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Nobleindie","id":"361351593292988425","is_bot":0,"username":"nobleindie"},"author_id":"361351593292988425","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Lilia looks at the gathered knights then nods to Web \"Go ahead and begin.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:04:27.504000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746127538274697367","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Web nods. \"Want to get Knights and Masons on same page.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:04:35.773000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746127572957397012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"They stand up and begin to speak:","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:04:46.759000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746127619036020859","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"As most know, Masons' plan to defeat hunger involved poisoned divinity. Was using old magic, older than Hunger and more powerful. Unified set of intentions, all deceased Masons and Tinkers combining power in sacrificial magic. If done right, could have unmade hunger. Kill for good.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:06:18.886000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746128005444796457","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"But because Dregen isolated for so long and secrets kept too close, not enough communication between Knights and Masons. Simply, the two plans redundant.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:07:05.536000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746128201109209141","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"If Knights' ritual works and can kill hunger for good, no need to feed poisoned divinity.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:07:53.492000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746128402251251812","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Instead, souls will serve another purpose.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:08:11.263000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746128476787965977","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Barrier between old and new world serves two purposes: to prevent hunger from consuming old world, and to prevent evil gods from obtaining foothold in new world. Sadly, that means have to block good gods too.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:09:31.686000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746128814106738791","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"But barrier damaged. That how Mello able to arrive with us. If use intentions and souls right, can restore barrier.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:10:49.998000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746129142571073660","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Barrier originally take long time to set up, very delicate. But with power of deceased, can restore quickly. So timing can be controlled precisely.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:11:54.555000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746129413342625844","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Web know that should hunger be defeated, knights intend to restore old gods, ones originally consumed by hunger. Old masons opposed this, believing would also invite more evil gods to new world and cause more harm then good. Web unsure if that true, but it unimportant.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:13:37.201000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746129843871154298","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"If barrier could be restored right after gods are, no chance for evil gods to arrive at new world. Have benefits of old gods restored without inviting more evil.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:14:30.520000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746130067507118122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"Web grins. \"Web believe new plan better, allow Masons and Knights to work together. And hopefully increase cooperation between orders for time to come.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:15:20.979000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746130279147503688","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739546506184491089","content":"\"Thoughts? Questions?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T22:15:29.738000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746130315885412425","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
